    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should see a doctor but what's the point? they'll just give me more pills that make me feel groggy or tell me that it's just part of getting old. it's not just the pain though. it's the feeling that i'm just a burden now. everything i do is a struggle and i'm just taking up space in a house that feels too big for one person. it feels like the world has moved on and i'm just stuck here in the dark.",
